  "articleBody": "Converting a garage into living space can add a bedroom, office, guest suite, or separate ADU, but the project must begin with a feasibility review rather than demolition. In San Diego County, the design must address permits, zoning, structure, insulation, moisture control, natural light, ventilation, electrical systems, plumbing, emergency escape, and the intended relationship to the main home.",
